  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1768109208_7365394_85564fe7c8e210742a960430ae63cc7a.jpeg",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">Affiliate Program Overview</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">ABOUT OUR BRAND</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">We are a lingerie brand created to celebrate confidence, comfort, and real bodies. Our pieces are designed to make</span><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\"> women feel powerful, sexy, and supported - whether they are dressing for themselves or someone</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">special. We believe lingerie should feel as good as it looks, without sacrificing quality or inclusivity.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">ABOUT OUR LINGERIE</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">Our lingerie blends flattering silhouettes, premium fabrics, and thoughtful design. Each piece is crafted to</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">enhance natural curves, provide all-day comfort, and elevate everyday moments. From sensual statement</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">pieces to comfortable essentials, our collections are made to fit real life - not unrealistic standards.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">WHAT MAKES US DIFFERENT</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">- Body-positive and inclusive sizing</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">- Comfort-first designs without compromising sex appeal</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">- High-quality materials at accessible price points</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">- A brand built around confidence, not perfection</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">- We listen to our community and design with real women in mind</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">HOW AFFILIATES CAN EARN</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">Affiliates earn commission on every sale made through their unique referral link.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">- Competitive commission rates</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">- No cap on earnings</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">- Easy tracking and transparent payouts</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">- Bonuses and special campaigns for top performers</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">HOW TO PROMOTE US</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">Affiliates can promote our brand through:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">- Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, or Pinterest</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">- Lingerie try-ons, styling content, and reviews</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">- Confidence-focused or body-positive content</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">- Blog posts, email marketing, or curated links</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">- Honest storytelling about how our lingerie makes you feelWe encourage authentic promotion - your voice and creativity matter more than perfection.</span></p><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"></div><p><br></p></div>",
